<title>BELARUS: Coca-Cola Amatil begins building Belarus plant.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Amatil begins building Belarus plant.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coca Cola Amatil has begun construction of a $50 million bottling plant here, a Foreign Trade Ministry official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The investment is about $50 million and it is the largest investment in Belarus to date,&quot; the head of the ministry's investment department, Igor Butoma, said.</p>
<p>The company began talks with the government a year ago but had to wait for a land permit before starting construction.</p>
<p>--Larisa Sayenko, Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264</p>
